  "description": "A beautiful collection of watercolor fig clipart featuring ripe figs, fig branches, botanical fig, fig trees, artisan foods, wholesome breakfasts, and Mediterranean-inspired desserts. Designed in a soft modern watercolor style with rich fig tones, natural textures, and elegant botanical details, this collection captures the luxurious and timeless charm of fresh figs.\n✨ Perfect for:\n• Print on Demand products\n• Stickers and sticker sheets\n• Scrapbooking projects\n• Journals and planners\n• Greeting cards and invitations\n• Packaging and branding projects\n• Social media graphics\n• Digital and printable crafts\n• Mediterranean-themed designs\n• Food and culinary projects\n🤍 What’s included:\n– 20 high-quality illustrations\n– Transparent background\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print & digital use)\n– 20 PNG files (transparent background)\n– 20 SVG files\n🍃 Included illustrations:\nwhole fig and halved fig, fig branch with leaves and fruit, cluster of ripe figs, young green figs on a branch, fig leaf botanical study, assortment of whole and sliced figs, fig tree in terracotta pot, botanical fig study with leaf and fruit, wooden bowl of fresh figs, fig jam jar, sliced figs on wooden board, dried figs in ceramic bowl, yogurt with figs and honey, oatmeal with figs and walnuts, ricotta toast with figs, fresh cheese with figs and honey, rustic fig galette, fig and rosemary focaccia, fig tart, figs with honeycomb and honey drizzle etc.\n✨ Inspired by Mediterranean orchards, fig groves, artisan bakeries, rustic kitchens, healthy breakfasts, seasonal harvests, botanical illustrations, and elegant fruit-forward cuisine. These illustrations are perfect for creating warm, sophisticated, and nature-inspired designs with a modern watercolor aesthetic.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>A beautiful collection of watercolor fig clipart featuring ripe figs, fig branches, botanical fig, fig trees, artisan foods, wholesome breakfasts, and Mediterranean-inspired desserts. Designed in a soft modern watercolor style with rich fig tones, natural textures, and elegant botanical details, this collection captures the luxurious and timeless charm of fresh figs.</p>\n<p>✨ Perfect for:<br>\n• Print on Demand products<br>\n• Stickers and sticker sheets<br>\n• Scrapbooking projects<br>\n• Journals and planners<br>\n• Greeting cards and invitations<br>\n• Packaging and branding projects<br>\n• Social media graphics<br>\n• Digital and printable crafts<br>\n• Mediterranean-themed designs<br>\n• Food and culinary projects</p>\n<p>🤍 What’s included:</p>\n<p>– 20 high-quality illustrations<br>\n– Transparent background<br>\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print &amp; digital use)<br>\n– 20 PNG files (transparent background)<br>\n– 20 SVG files</p>\n<p>🍃 Included illustrations:<br>\nwhole fig and halved fig, fig branch with leaves and fruit, cluster of ripe figs, young green figs on a branch, fig leaf botanical study, assortment of whole and sliced figs, fig tree in terracotta pot, botanical fig study with leaf and fruit, wooden bowl of fresh figs, fig jam jar, sliced figs on wooden board, dried figs in ceramic bowl, yogurt with figs and honey, oatmeal with figs and walnuts, ricotta toast with figs, fresh cheese with figs and honey, rustic fig galette, fig and rosemary focaccia, fig tart, figs with honeycomb and honey drizzle etc.</p>\n<p>✨ Inspired by Mediterranean orchards, fig groves, artisan bakeries, rustic kitchens, healthy breakfasts, seasonal harvests, botanical illustrations, and elegant fruit-forward cuisine. These illustrations are perfect for creating warm, sophisticated, and nature-inspired designs with a modern watercolor aesthetic.</p>",
